   "idx": 8,
   "zh": "全会回顾党100多年来的奋斗历程，指出中国共产党能够从胜利走向胜利，就在于胸怀共产主义远大理想，立志于中华民族千秋伟业，坚持为中国人民谋幸福、为中华民族谋复兴，在各个历史时期都高度重视管党治党，勇于坚持真理、修正错误，在依靠自身力量和人民支持解决自身问题中不断强大，成为党和人民事业的坚强领导核心。在革命、建设、改革中先后把党的建设作为伟大工程、新的伟大工程，党的十八大以来深入推进新时代党的建设新的伟大工程，找到“让人民来监督政府”和“自我革命”两个跳出治乱兴衰历史周期率的答案，这是中国共产党的独特创造，永载马克思主义政党建设史册。",
   "en": "Looking back on the Party's journey since its founding, the Central Committee pointed out at the session that the key to the success of the Communist Party of China in winning one victory after another lies in its pursuit of the high ideal of communism, its dedication to achieving lasting greatness for the Chinese nation, and its commitment to seeking happiness for the Chinese people and rejuvenation for the Chinese nation. During each historical period, the Party has attached great importance to its self-governance, had the courage to uphold truth and correct errors, and grown ever stronger by relying on its own efforts and the support of the people to resolve its own problems, ultimately emerging as the strong leadership core in the cause of the Party and the people. The Party advanced Party building as a great project and then a great new project in the periods of revolution, development, and reform, and it has made further progress in this regard in the new era since its 18th National Congress. During this course, the Party has found two answers to the question of how to escape the historical cycle of rise and fall: the people's oversight over government and the Party's self-reform. These are the unique discoveries of the Communist Party of China, and will forever stand out in the history of Marxist parties.",
